WEBVTT

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:30.265
Agar ilohiy qudrat senga shu vazifani bergan bo'lsa

00:18:30.265 --> 00:18:35.349
va bir daqiqaga bo'lsa ham o'z ajoyibotni aks sening ishingda

00:18:35.349 --> 00:18:37.349
aks ettirishga qaror qilsa, unda " Ole!"

00:18:37.349 --> 00:18:40.988
agar bo'lmasa, mayli o'zingcha raqs tushaver.

00:18:40.988 --> 00:18:42.669
Va nima bo'lsa ham sizga "Ole!"

00:18:42.669 --> 00:18:44.669
Va menimcha biz bu fikrni o'rgatishimiz kerak

00:18:44.669 --> 00:18:46.457
"Ole!", nima bo'lsa ham.

00:18:46.457 --> 00:18:49.770
inson muhabbati va injiqligi uchun

00:18:49.770 --> 00:18:51.615
va harakat uchun

00:18:51.615 --> 00:18:53.290
Rahmat.

00:18:53.290 --> 00:18:55.365
(Qarsaklar)

00:18:55.365 --> 00:18:56.856
Rahmat.

00:18:56.856 --> 00:18:59.970
(Qarsaklar)

00:18:59.970 --> 00:19:01.803
June Cohen: Ole!